why do we need decorator design pattern ?

to avoid class explosion ?


suppose if you create differnce permutatuion of class like differnt permutaion of toppings it will crete large number of class
which is difficult to manage

It has four components

1) component interface - it is an interace or abstract class which is extended by concrete component and
                        decorator both. in this eample , It is represented by BasePizza
2) concrete component - it a class that extends concrete componsent and on
                        which additional feature is added using decoraor class.(FarmHouse and VegDeight are reprsented as this)
3) decorator(Important role play as it has well as is-a relationship) - it is being used to add feture to base class .
it extends component interface as well as has its object (Topping Decorator is represented by this )
4) concrete decorator - it extends decorator with different feature name.Tomatoa and Mushrrom represent this

